   "answer": "Сильнее всего выросло лекарство **Цетиризин** (ID: 1019). Рост среднедневных продаж составил **30,32 %**.\n\n**Расчёт:**\n1. Среднедневные продажи в феврале 2025: 61,86.\n2. Среднедневные продажи в марте 2025: 80,61.\n3. Процент роста: 30,32 %.",
   "used_tools": [
    "run_sql"
   ],
   "fact_checks": [
    {
     "key": "medicine.growth_percent",
     "comparison": "approx",
     "expected": 30.3211,
     "result": true,
     "passed": true,
     "source": "current"
    }
   ],
   "plan": [
    {
     "tool": "run_sql",
     "args": {
      "sql": "WITH monthly_sales AS (\n  SELECT\n    id_lekarstva,\n    ANY_VALUE(deystvuyuschee_veschestvo) AS deystvuyuschee_veschestvo,\n    SUM(CASE WHEN data >= '2025-02-01' AND data < '2025-03-01' THEN skol_ko_kupili ELSE 0 END) AS sum_feb,\n    SUM(CASE WHEN data >= '2025-03-01' AND data < '2025-04-01' THEN skol_ko_kupili ELSE 0 END) AS sum_mar\n  FROM \"09_lekarstvennye_preparaty\"\n  WHERE data >= '2025-02-01' AND data < '2025-04-01'\n  GROUP BY id_lekarstva\n)\nSELECT\n  id_lekarstva,\n  deystvuyuschee_veschestvo,\n  sum_feb,\n  sum_mar,\n  sum_feb / 28.0 AS feb_avg_daily,\n  sum_mar / 31.0 AS mar_avg_daily,\n  CASE WHEN feb_avg_daily > 0 THEN (mar_avg_daily - feb_avg_daily) / feb_avg_daily * 100.0 ELSE NULL END AS growth_pct\nFROM monthly_sales\nORDER BY growth_pct DESC\nLIMIT 1"
     }
    }
   ],
